-- Small slice of the exercise catalog for local development and CI.
--
-- Every row of the lookup tables, plus the first 40 exercises by id with their
-- names and secondary muscles. `exercises` is the private import source; it is only
-- here as the target of a foreign key, so it keeps just the id and the name.
-- The full catalog is loaded from production; keep it out of git (seed.full.sql).
-- scripts/__tests__/seed.test.ts enforces these rules.

SET standard_conforming_strings = on;








